{
  "software": "multi_apps",
  "supported_action_types": ["batch"],
  "target": "multi_apps",
  "example_limit": 12,
  "description": "Coordinates 2-3 child applications in one task. Always use a batch action targeted at multi_apps. Each item names the child app and embeds the exact action that child adapter should execute. Use child app names exactly as shown in related_apps and element namespaces, such as code_server, jupyterlab, gitea, libreoffice, libreoffice_writer, libreoffice_impress, nautilus, gimp, inkscape, drawio, blender, audacity, kdenlive, obs, and thunderbird.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "name": "batch",
      "description": "Execute one or more child-app actions in sequence, then observe the combined multi-app state.",
      "params_schema": {
        "actions": [
          {
            "app": "child app name from related_apps",
            "action": {
              "action_type": "child adapter action_type, for example modify_file, api_call, invoke_function, navigate, or set_value",
              "target": "child-local target without the app:: namespace",
              "params": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "description": "Create exact notes in code-server and JupyterLab workspaces",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "code_server",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "workspace",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "create_file",
                          "path": "reports/multi_001_handoff.md",
                          "content": "MA-001 code handoff complete\n"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "app": "jupyterlab",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "workspace",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "create_file",
                          "path": "reports/multi_001_analysis.md",
                          "content": "MA-001 notebook analysis saved\n"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Rename a file in Nautilus and create a companion workspace note",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "nautilus",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "invoke_function",
                    "target": "nautilus",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "rename_entry",
                          "path": "meeting-notes.md",
                          "new_name": "meeting-notes-multi_023.md"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "app": "code_server",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "workspace",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "create_file",
                          "path": "reports/multi_023_handoff.md",
                          "content": "MA-023 code handoff complete\n"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Create a workspace file and a Gitea issue",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "code_server",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "workspace",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "create_file",
                          "path": "reports/release.md",
                          "content": "Release handoff complete\n"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "app": "gitea",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "api_call",
                    "target": "gitea_rest",
                    "params": {
                      "method": "POST",
                      "endpoint": "/api/v1/repos/{{owner}}/{{repo}}/issues",
                      "body": {
                        "title": "Release coordination",
                        "body": "Tracking issue created from the multi-app task."
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Update LibreOffice Calc and Writer together",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "libreoffice",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "document",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "sheet": "Sheet1",
                          "cell": "D6",
                          "value": "MA-013 spreadsheet signoff",
                          "value_type": "string"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "app": "libreoffice_writer",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "document",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_paragraph",
                          "text": "MA-013 narrative release note"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Add an Impress slide",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "libreoffice_impress",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "document",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_slide",
                          "title": "MA-014 launch slide",
                          "body": ["Launch summary"]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Create or update a diagram shape in draw.io",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "drawio",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "diagram",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_shape",
                          "id": "ma_release_box",
                          "label": "MA release ready",
                          "shape_kind": "rectangle",
                          "x": 120,
                          "y": 100,
                          "width": 180,
                          "height": 80,
                          "fill": "#e0f2fe",
                          "stroke": "#0369a1"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Add a visible text layer in GIMP",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "gimp",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "invoke_function",
                    "target": "gimp",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_text_layer",
                          "id": "gimp_multi_040",
                          "label": "MA-040 asset",
                          "text": "MA-040 asset",
                          "x": 80,
                          "y": 90,
                          "font_size": 26,
                          "color": "#0f766e"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Add SVG text in Inkscape",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "inkscape",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "document",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_element",
                          "parent_xpath": "/*[local-name()='svg']",
                          "tag": "text",
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "ma_svg_label",
                            "x": "80",
                            "y": "80",
                            "text_content": "MA vector ready"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Add an Audacity label",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "audacity",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "audacity_project",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_label",
                          "label_id": "aud_multi_045",
                          "text": "MA-045 audio cue",
                          "start": 5.5,
                          "end": 6.5
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Add a Kdenlive marker",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "kdenlive",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "modify_file",
                    "target": "project",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_element",
                          "parent_xpath": "./guides",
                          "tag": "marker",
                          "attributes": {
                            "id": "kd_multi_045",
                            "frame": "135",
                            "comment": "MA-045 edit marker",
                            "color": "#0f766e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Tag the Thunderbird client follow-up message",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "thunderbird",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "invoke_function",
                    "target": "thunderbird",
                    "params": {
                      "operations": [
                        {
                          "action": "add_tag",
                          "id": "msg_client_followup",
                          "tag": "multi-057"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "Update an OBS scene through its API adapter",
          "action": {
            "action_type": "batch",
            "target": "multi_apps",
            "params": {
              "actions": [
                {
                  "app": "obs",
                  "action": {
                    "action_type": "api_call",
                    "target": "obs_websocket",
                    "params": {
                      "request_type": "SetCurrentProgramScene",
                      "request_data": {
                        "sceneName": "Scene 2"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "done_action": {
    "description": "Return this action when every involved app visibly satisfies the task.",
    "example": {
      "action_type": "done",
      "target": "",
      "params": {}
    }
  },
  "tips": [
    "Prefer one batch containing all required child-app changes when the instruction gives exact target values.",
    "For Nautilus file-manager tasks, use child action_type invoke_function, target nautilus, and operations such as rename_entry, move_entry, copy_entry, trash_entry, open_directory, and search_entries.",
    "For code_server and jupyterlab file tasks, use child action_type modify_file, target workspace, and operations such as create_file, set_file_text, append_text, replace_text, rename_path, delete_path, set_cell_source, and set_cell_output.",
    "For Gitea issue tasks, use api_call with endpoint /api/v1/repos/{{owner}}/{{repo}}/issues and body.title matching the requested issue title exactly.",
    "For GIMP, use target gimp. For Audacity, use target audacity_project. For Thunderbird, use target thunderbird and operations[].id=msg_client_followup for the client follow-up message.",
    "For Kdenlive marker tasks, use modify_file target project and add a marker as an add_element operation under parent_xpath ./guides.",
    "For child-local targets, remove the namespace prefix: use workspace, document, diagram, gitea_rest, audacity_project, thunderbird, or obs_websocket rather than code_server::..., drawio::..., or gitea::....",
    "Use exact strings from the task instruction. If a required text value is quoted, copy it exactly.",
    "After the combined observation shows all requested artifacts, return the done action."
  ]
}
